Subject: [PATCH] [M159] [security] Disable SendEarlyFinalBeginMainFrame

FlyWeb port (not yet merged to M156): branch-heads/8154 ce5896ca0a (main 48f78635b5). Flips the cc killswitch kSendEarlyFinalBeginMainFrame to disabled by default; the feature exists in 156 enabled by default (cc/base/features.cc) and is used in cc/trees/layer_tree_host.cc. Applies to Mac (cc is cross-platform). Same diff as upstream; applies with line offsets only. No brave-core patches or chromium_src for these files. Severity of 576628035 not public (bug restricted).

